0 minute chart, we can clearly see the ‘limits’ of the flag. I also see beautiful CP leading up to the FL\n\nI am attempting to find some local FLs, the 5 min chart shows a Local FL, and the only entries I see are either TT the local FL. I would have ratheR that price engulfed the blue FTR (1) but all price did in this situation was consume enough buy orders to allow price to pass through the next demand, the best entry would have been to sell the RT on the FTR above (2).\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#269","p":11,"im":["f74d7283bf9dc0ed8ab579988ed98780c0f2173c","37fbd33ebf54b0e3a5be403efd5f95d79a42ebd5","357f3774e0197b52321ab020168ddbb2559337cd"],"m":269},{"id":"flaglimits_p11_270","t":"Aaron\n\nHere is another FL setup which I saw.\n\nDetails on the charts\n\nAUD-2010\n\n1707\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#270","p":11,"im":["8f1321a0d8245969a72e45256b7df1aa2d66e897","af6dcfc7146ee06077fb0c675af0510bc83a5487","bef8cf87600773b681b682f7b49b4834ceb1892c","6f1a6516c8570a1e5d06d0d069db399740e7f01f"],"m":270},{"id":"flaglimits_p11_271","t":"Harry\n\nDaft trader 1 wrote: Here is another FL setup which I saw.\n\nDetails on the charts\n\nAUD-2010\n\n2920\n\ntrading that FL in H4 would be a fail, depending how tight your stop was it would have given you a chance to exit. i got some notes on your 3rd chart\n\nnice work DT1","a":"—","d":"","n":"#271","p":11,"im":["33ea6bedac7fa2404ff8ea365975ee83e8f87e55"],"m":271},{"id":"flaglimits_p11_272","t":"Aaron\n\nThanks Harry,\n\nMuch appreciated, here is another one, I have really enjoyed studying the different variations of P.A in FL and FTRs when price breaks or engulfs the level, I like the challenge of seeing if I can enter using different P.A concepts thus having a loss.\n\nDetails are on the charts:\n\n1707\n\nCheers all.\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#272","p":11,"im":["a4cbeb2754f314fb97521b5f8146250e613bb807","2ebaeccf4da8f31dbaef0a75e6091f5844b04b62","3ba728039a2dd9459f293eb591c966a96fe2834e"],"m":272},{"id":"flaglimits_p11_273","t"